# Copilot Instructions

## Project Guidelines
- For this repository, Google AI RSS HTML cleanup must apply only to the generated feed/archive content. It must never delete articles, modify their stored HTML, or change their publication status; preserve article text, semantic markup, and images in the feed.
- Hangfire job methods must be async (`Task`-returning) and use `await`; never block async calls with `.Result` or `.GetAwaiter().GetResult()`.
- `QuarkDataContext` is not thread-safe. In Hangfire/background services, do not run concurrent operations on the shared scoped context; for direct queries in job services, create a short-lived context via `IDbContextFactory<QuarkDataContext>` (registered in `Quark.Hangfire/Program.cs`).